      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is your Download Safety Setting Inverted or something?\nCuz i've seen models who file size are at 1MB with some blendshapes used for facial and the rest not being used doing just fine.\nWhile another who didn't use any facial blendshapes having file size of over 100+ MB with animations. \nMost of the file size are driven thru Animations, Textures, Materials, and Bones. I dont see how Blendshapes contribute heavily to file size. \nunless someone can prove me wrong that \" Skin Mesh \" controlled mostly by Bones is heavier than blendshapes to the face.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
